


>> CoffeeMachine := वस्तु नयाँ.
CoffeeMachine जब: ['order:'] गर: { :id
	>> coffee := ['Americano'].
	( id = 1 ) सत्य-भए: {
		coffee := ['Cappuccino'].
	}.
	( id = 2 ) सत्य-भए: {
		coffee := ['Espresso'].
	}.
	( id = 3 ) सत्य-भए: {
		coffee := ['Latte'].
	}. <- coffee.
}.
>> SimpleCoffeeMachine := वस्तु नयाँ.
SimpleCoffeeMachine जब: ['order'] गर: { <- ['Black']. }.
>> redCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
आउटपुट लेख: redCup, नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
redCup := ['Tea']. 
>> greenCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
आउटपुट लेख: greenCup, नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
>> yellowCup := CoffeeMachine order: 1.
आउटपुट लेख: yellowCup, नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
>> blueCup := CoffeeMachine order: 0.
आउटपुट लेख: blueCup, नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
>> plasticCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
plasticCup := ['Lemonade']. 
>> blackCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
आउटपुट लेख: blackCup, नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
blackCup अन्त्यमा-थप: [' nooo.... beer. '].
>> orangeCup := SimpleCoffeeMachine order.
आउटपुट लेख: orangeCup, नयाँ-पङ्क्ति.
